  "title": "The Campbell’s Company to Report Fourth Quarter and Full Year Fiscal 2026 Results on September 3, 2026 - The Campbell's Company",
  "summary": "CAMDEN, N.J.–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Aug. 13, 2026– The Campbell’s Company (NASDAQ:CPB) (Campbell’s) announced it will report its financial results on September 3, 2026 for the fourth quarter and full year fiscal 2026 ended August 2, 2026. A press release, slide presentation, transcript and audio of pre-recorded management remarks will be available at 7:15 a.m. ET. Mick Beekhuizen, President and Chief Executive Officer, and Todd Cunfer, Executive Vice President […]",
